WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
Crack an egg.

2
00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:05.710
The white is clear and runny,
full of dissolved proteins.

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.590
Heat it, and it turns white and solid.

4
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.090
Let it cool, and it stays white.

5
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:15.220
Its proteins have lost their
shape, and with it, their job.

6
00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:18.390
A protein is only a chain of amino acids.

7
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:22.360
So how does it fold into the
exact shape its job needs?

8
00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:26.250
In this mission, you'll meet the
bonds that hold a fold in place:

9
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.450
most are weak, but
together they are strong.

10
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.750
Then you'll see what heat and a
change in pH do to those bonds.

11
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:39.040
Your mission: find out how a chain of
amino acids folds into the exact shape its

12
00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.120
job needs.
